    "media:imagetext": "BAR\nONBOARD\nLONG DAY?\nTALL DRINK?\nFeel like a drink to relax and\nunwind? Now you can with\nour new bar onboard service.\nWe've listened to your feedback and\nhave introduced a new bar service to\nour domestic flights.\nInitially the service will operate on\nselected 737 flights between Auckland,\nWellington, Christchurch, Dunedin and\nQueenstown with a scheduled departure\nafter 4.30pm.\nWe value your feedback and are\ncontinuously looking for ways to\nimprove our service.",
